Charge through your opponents, attacking anyone near your path for 35% (at 0 Hate) to 70% (at 100+ Hate) damage. [Small, Small, Medium-sized, Medium-sized, Big (TL1-5)] opponents may be knocked away from your path. You can attack a maximum of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] times, and can hit targets along your path more than once.
